      "message": "Could we make `register_nissa_project` automatically compose these paths? That would make it hard to misuse and reduce some boilerplate.\n\n```\nextra_dts_overlays \u003d [\n    here / project_name / filename for filename in extra_dts_overlays\n]\nkconfig_files \u003d [here / \"prj.conf\", here / project_name / \"prj.conf\"]\n```\n\nPossibly even better, we could glob for DTS files and avoid needing to put all the names in here (assuming we\u0027d never want to include a file that\u0027s not used or have a subdirectory inside a project):\n\n```\ndts_overlays \u003d [\"cbi.dts\"] + (here / project_name).glob(\u0027*.dts\u0027)\n```",
      "revId": "8003445ce1979f42150d68c8a28f350f896d25c2",
